                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Drunken brawl simulator where you have to start fights and cause total chaos in various situations\n\n✅Variety of locations: different from each other, such as a prison, a cemetery, or office restrooms\n✅Enemy animations: After defeating characters, they fall and lie limp\n✅Colorful graphics\n\n❌Imprecise hitboxes; blows often miss despite proper character positioning\n❌Very slow character movement\n❌No way to effectively avoid attacks \n❌ you can only move forward, backward, and turn\n❌You mainly fight enemies and escape the horde, which is boring\n❌Only two types of attacks: a slow punch and a kick\n❌Uncomfortable controls\n❌The price is too high for a game of this caliber\n\n❌❌ Verdict: [b] Terrible [/b], [strike] Bad [/strike], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [strike] Decent [/strike], [strike] Good [/strike], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for short games, retro indie simulator games, and similar)\n\n[quote]If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page: [url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand on my group: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.I'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!Best regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
